{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SAYONALAIKA</strong> is an adventure game where you walk through landscapes filled with memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627340/extras/SAYONALAIKA_store_616x158_001.png?t=1743704549\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has been a year since my friend passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I never even had the chance to say goodbye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As I go about my daily life, I find myself suddenly remembering her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You used to be with me in so many places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I feel\u2026 a little\u2014no, a lot\u2014lonely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that\u2019s not all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627340/extras/SAYONALAIKA_store_616x158_002.png?t=1743704549\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A walking simulator where various events unfold as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quest markers or time limits\u2014enjoy a relaxed gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t know the names of the stars, yet I still gazed at the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 15\u201360 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming is allowed without prior permission, both for individuals and businesses.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627340?t=1743704549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap